00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:39.430
Apa ekspresinya sangat lembut .

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:42.350
Datesthets tactician , yang pecah melalui enciclementments sempurna kami ,

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:46.560
